  "ingredients": [
    "1 beef bouillon cube",
    "1 cup warm water",
    "0.5 cup soy sauce",
    "0.33333334326744 cup brown sugar",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 tablespoon sesame oil",
    "1.5 pounds beef sirloin, cut into 1-inch strips",
    "2 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "2 pounds broccoli florets, or to taste",
    "2 cups cooked jasmine rice",
    "1 tablespoon sesame seeds, for garnish"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S3vILty0l-bPJD9G-on3tyUw4sA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238393-slow-cooker-broccoli-beef-DDMFS-step01-984c7e81942443189a370f6da2a3fb72.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238393/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crumble beef bouillon cube into warm water in a bowl and stir to dissolve. Add soy sauce, brown sugar, garlic, and sesame oil and stir to dissolve sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yXjUM7bFqXyAXHs-ZeWBVnc8vJw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238393-slow-cooker-broccoli-beef-DDMFS-step02-6ea71be5ee55437494fe87eb4e4ac252.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238393/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place beef strips into a slow cooker crock. Pour sauce mixture over beef.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S_ybaP_5p73BtBDppSXr-_bsXcQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238393-slow-cooker-broccoli-beef-DDMFS-step03-99db15d5ceb349a0ae3b887ed279ebc8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238393/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover, and cook until beef is tender enough to cut with a spoon, on Low for 6 to 8 hours or High for 4 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YhexG2s_uqE_DOjG9sRBQPTPbDA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238393-slow-cooker-broccoli-beef-DDMFS-step04-da6f045f003b4eb48b19a1384b07ab5a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238393/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon 2 tablespoons liquid from the slow cooker into a bowl. Whisk cornstarch into the liquid and stir the cornstarch mixture into the liquid in the slow cooker until evenly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-zeUzp5Defy3aCc4lF5y18O4ruQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238393-slow-cooker-broccoli-beef-DDMFS-step05-63dbc7c259584fe9a016b112dae31deb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238393/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook on High until the sauce thickens, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GzITktStEqC7olijzd5PwEf89GQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238393-slow-cooker-broccoli-beef-DDMFS-step06-5cdb843992b94d088ff1200105e481c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238393/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a steamer insert into a saucepan and fill with water to just below the bottom of the steamer. Bring water to a boil. Cook broccoli in covered steamer until tender, 2 to 6 minutes; add to sauce in slow cooker and stir to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c7fQvDLbiLnphYIBfb11I96r_BI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238393-slow-cooker-broccoli-beef-DDMFS-step07-c99a5327ee62488e882402fc72611e8b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238393/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve beef and broccoli with sauce over portions of cooked jasmine rice and garnish with sesame seeds.",
